  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello VRChat Team,\n\nI would like to request a feature for Desktop Mode that allows users to extend and grab objects more freely, similar to how it works in VR Mode. \n\nSpecifically, I’d like to be able to use mouse inputs to simulate reaching and grabbing actions, such as:\n\n- Extending a hand with the left click, and grabbing with the right click.\n\n  or\n\n- Using left click for the left hand and right click for the right hand to extend and grab.\n\nEven when nothing is currently grabbable, it would be great if the avatar’s hand could still extend with a click, just like in VR Mode. This feature would improve immersion and interactivity for desktop players.\n\nThank you for your consideration.",
